WEBVTT

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.120
Come to think of it,

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:08.820
how much do I actually know about Satou?

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.540
Do you know this girl?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.250
Maybe Matsuzaka kidnapped this girl.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.390
Never seen her.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.420
I see.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.920
Sorry to bother you.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.240
Hey!

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.720
Coming!

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.890
Oh, it's you again!

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:31.130
Thanks for thinking of Taiyo.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:38.760
Sorry, but he said he doesn't want
to see anyone today either.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:41.640
Oh, really? I see.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.780
And here's a message from work.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:49.690
Please tell him to call us
when he feels like coming back to work.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.980
Okay. Thanks.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.120
It's nothing.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.690
I've got a few things
I'd like to say to him myself too.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.550
Well, see you soon.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:04.580
Okay. Thank you, sweetie.

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.170
Oh, goodness!

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.600
Matsuzaka just brought--

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.460
Yeah. Thanks.

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:26.970
Shall I let you see shio-chan?

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.830
Actually,

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:37.110
I talked to someone in the park.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:40.030
A guy. Taiyo.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.140
It has been over three months,

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:58.570
and I haven't made contact
with Satou Matsuzaka's aunt even once.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.670
I'm sure of it now.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.630
I was disposing of...

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.140
Her aunt?

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:15.870
I don't care why she killed her.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.370
All I have to do is get proof.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.380
I wonder what kind of face she'll make
when I rub the proof in it.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.490
Just thinking about it makes me...

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.330
Thanks for your hard work.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.930
Satou, you're late today.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:36.130
Yeah. I had them give me a later shift.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.170
Oh, Matsuzaka! Thanks for today.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.690
Sorry to ask you.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:40.840
No problem.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.010
How was Mitsuboshi?

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.900
I didn't see him today either.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.050
I see.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:49.190
Maybe he's not coming back.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:51.720
That's what the manager was worried about.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.240
He wouldn't see you either, right, Shoko?

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.400
That's right.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:59.660
I'm sure Mitsuboshi knows
he can't keep going on like this.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.320
So I'm going to keep trying.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.110
Then I'll leave that to you.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.130
Now, let's hit the floor.

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:08.490
Okay!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.920
That reminds me,

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:13.410
Su-chan stopped coming at around the same time.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.640
I think in Su-chan's case,

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.170
it couldn't be helped.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.560
Yeah.

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:24.800
Well, no use talking about them if they're gone.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:29.470
Satou.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.280
How are you and your boyfriend doing lately?

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.530
We're great.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:36.770
We're so intimate and happy every day.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.080
I see. I'd like to meet him once,

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.190
this lover who has you so head over heels.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.030
Someday.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.780
Welcome!

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:55.290
Thank you for your order.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.710
Thank you!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.300
Speaker

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:16.160
Oh, Mom? Sorry.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:20.120
I'm studying with my friend at the library now.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:23.360
Yes. Okay.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:30.250
Hey, girl. You're so cute.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:34.430
The two of us used to hang out around here.

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.350
Satou.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:41.670
Why are you always dating a new guy all the time?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.270
I guess because I still haven't found it.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.090
My one and only.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:48.400
Once I find it,

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:52.450
I'll probably stop doing stuff like this.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.740
One and only...

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.280
A prince who's mine and mine alone.

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:00.190
I thought she was the same as me.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:04.400
That's why I felt safe
and had fun when I was with her.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.170
A dear friend.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.950
Your buns are so cute!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.550
Really?

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:18.790
Bounce! Bounce!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.710
Here, I'll comb your hair.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.890
Where is he?

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.140
Hey!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:43.650
You're sleeping under there again?

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.750
Wake up!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.780
What--? Wait!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.320
Here.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.260
I don't have any money.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.620
I'm giving it to you.

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:00.310
I'm fine.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:06.180
Listen, I'm giving it to you because I bought it for lunch,
but couldn't eat it.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.750
It'll just go to waste.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.920
Thank you.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.110
You're welcome.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:15.780
I don't want you to go hungry and pass out again.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:18.890
I was so surprised the first time I met him.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.660
Hey!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:28.070
You're hungry, right?

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.940
You can have this if you like.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:33.460
Take it.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:38.280
He's finally eating next to me.

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:43.220
He looks like a hamster.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:47.630
Maybe I should be giving him
something more nutritious.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.050
Shio Koube
Missing

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:54.260
Shio Koube
Missing

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.610
Thanks for the meal.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.300
Yeah.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.820
Are you full now?

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:01.600
Well, good.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.620
Hey. Don't sleep under the bench anymore.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.830
It's dangerous.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:11.400
I figured the top was more dangerous
so I picked underneath.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:15.190
No! It's not a matter of sleeping on the bench or under it!

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:17.030
Go back home!

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:24.250
This kid has always seemed a bit sketchy.

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:27.670
Though his face is kind of cute.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.390
Thanks for helping me all the time.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:32.350
It's not a big deal.

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:33.970
Really, but...

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:35.880
Hey.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.860
What happened to this girl?

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.430
I know you've been searching for her for a while.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:43.350
What is she to you? Your family?

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:49.240
Asahi, I'm sorry.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.360
Asahi...

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.400
The moon.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.970
Shio is our moon.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.070
Our one and only in this world.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.990
Our irreplaceable...

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.000
We Revolve Around the Moon
We Revolve Around the Moon

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:08.560
Right.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:11.670
She's the moon that shines down on us.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.510
Asahi...

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:19.820
I'm sorry, Asahi.

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:22.110
I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:24.020
That's not true, Mom.

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:28.740
You've always protected me.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:32.010
You've always held my hand.

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:34.080
Your hands are so warm.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:36.460
They make me feel safe.

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:42.380
That's why I want you to hold Shio's hand now.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.590
Shio is beautiful.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:48.220
Her smile is so bright.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:51.480
She's just like the moon.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:55.840
No. I can't leave you behind.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:11:00.260
If I leave too, he'll follow us for sure.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:04.070
When the time is right,
I'll come and get you.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:08.200
So protect Shio until then and wait for me.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.580
Asahi...

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.110
Our vows.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:19.840
In sickness and in health,

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:23.760
through happiness and sadness,

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:27.180
for richer, for poorer,

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:30.140
until death do us part,

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:35.060
I promise that
I will love the two of you.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.480
I promise, Asahi.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.010
No matter what.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.950
I'm sorry.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.110
I'm sorry...

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.820
Asahi!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.550
What are you doing over there?

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:06.700
Nothing.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.820
Liar!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:11.480
Are you waiting for those two?

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.920
Come over here!

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:17.730
Asahi.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:21.830
You actually know where they are, don't you?

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:23.490
Right?

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.840
I don't know!

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:29.270
Your face looks just like hers.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:31.180
But, you know...

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:37.370
Your mom always starts crying
the moment I hit her.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:40.330
She cries when I yell at her too.

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:44.110
She was a weak woman. Like she's made of paper.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:47.800
Do you really think a woman like that

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.660
can live on her own with a kid?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.640
Oh, well. She abandoned you,
so it shouldn't concern you.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:54.890
No!

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:56.830
Mom's not weak!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:00.480
You don't understand Mom at all!

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:08.760
I like how you can really take a beating.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:14.740
But, you know...

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:19.820
I wonder how much

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.110
you can endure.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.590
Hey, Asahi!

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:31.540
If you're not back from the store with booze
in 10 minutes,

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.890
you're getting hit.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.910
Oh, are you okay?

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.770
Don't.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.560
You shouldn't get involved with that kid.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.500
His father is really scary.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:06.210
And I heard the wife took their younger child
and left them.

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.960
She abandoned this kid?

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.410
What a terrible mother.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.890
You're wrong!

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:15.890
That devil.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:18.790
How long do I have to put up with him?

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:21.460
Mom.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:27.560
Asahi, let's live together. The three of us.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:29.700
I'll be waiting for that day.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.490
Okay? It's a promise.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.560
Shio...

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.150
Yeah.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.170
I promise.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:51.550
I'll be okay.

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:53.470
I can bear this.

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:03.900
Five years later,

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.460
the devil suddenly died.

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:14.890
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:17.730
Now I can finally

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.600
live together with them!

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:27.040
Mom!

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:31.240
Where's Shio?

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.590
It was too late.

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:36.410
Everything was.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.920
Hey! Are you okay?

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.790
Hey!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.570
I'm going home!

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:50.530
Wait!

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:53.610
If you see her, let me know.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:55.890
Before I'm too late for everything!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.660
It's still only 9.

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:08.190
I'll just make something up.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:12.000
It's a bad habit of mine.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.750
I avoid troublesome things.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.970
I feel ashamed of myself.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:21.910
Satou and that kid are both working hard
for the person they love.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:26.560
I doubted Satou just because
of what Mitsuboshi said,

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.300
but I'm scared to even ask her about it.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.350
At this rate,

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:34.470
I'll lose the precious bond I have with her.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:38.560
What I lack is the courage to face things.

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:42.770
Right, Satou?

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.750
Oh, there you are, Shoko-chan!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:51.110
Satou!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.590
We haven't hung out in a long time.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:54.750
Yeah.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.910
But are you sure you have time today?

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:00.330
Of course. I haven't hung out with you in a while.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.810
I missed you too.

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.240
This one is new!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.690
Here you go.

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:19.150
It's so soft and delicious.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:20.650
Then I'll have two.

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:23.450
-Oh, you're buying some? For your boyfriend?
-Thank you.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.950
Yeah. It's a present.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:31.690
Look! It says there's a new nail salon here.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:35.040
And it would seem you haven't been keeping up.

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:37.920
Yeah. I don't care right now.

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.870
I want to save money too.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.620
There you go again.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.410
You're always wearing un-sexy underwear too.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.640
It doesn't matter.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.330
Shoko-chan, aren't you going to buy anything?

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:51.210
Yeah.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.890
I have to ask her.

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:55.330
I have to face it.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:58.760
If I don't, I'll lose her.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.280
Hey, Satou.

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:05.350
I've been wondering about something for a while.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:08.730
Satou, you don't have a boyfriend, do you?

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.660
-What are you--?
-I can tell.

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:15.710
I've spent a lot of time with you.

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.960
You're not the same as before,

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:20.930
and it doesn't seem like you have a man around.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:25.720
To tell the truth,
when you told me you'd found someone special

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:29.250
and you'd quit fooling around with guys,
part of me felt lonely.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.290
And I know you had always said

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.440
that when you find your one and only,

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:37.130
you'd stop doing things like this.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.900
But I could feel it,

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:43.930
how uneasy you felt talking about it.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.980
So I started thinking.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:51.200
What's the reason you're lying like this to me?

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.900
To us?

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:56.860
I'm worried about you, Satou!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.950
Worried you're involved in something weird!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:03.340
You're my best friend!

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:08.110
No matter what it is, I'll accept it.
I'll even help as much as I can.

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:10.460
So I want you to tell me.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.630
I want you to tell me the whole truth.

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.470
Sorry. I can't.

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:26.490
My situation's not exactly normal.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.200
There are a lot of things I can't tell you.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.100
I don't want to drag you into this.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:34.910
Shoko-chan, you're a good girl.

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:38.170
I know that you care about me.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:42.490
That's why I want you to stop
trying to get involved.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.010
I don't want to lose you.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.960
Don't get involved anymore.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.080
Satou!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:53.920
Let's continue being good friends,
just like before. Okay?

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.750
She pushed me away.

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:00.220
This tea is delicious.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.390
It's no good.

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:07.610
I can't bring myself to pry into my friend's heart
any more than this.

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:10.890
I'd just be acting selfishly.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.810
--but I like hot chocolate more...

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:16.040
She might start hating me.

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.540
I'm scared.

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:20.000
I'm fine leaving things like this.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.110
I don't want to feel like this anymore.

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:26.530
Before I'm too late for everything!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.300
I have to tell her.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:33.210
Or else I could never be her true best friend!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:34.880
All right, Shoko-chan.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.790
Let's get go--

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:40.150
Satou...

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:45.690
You opened the door for me
when I was stuck in a small world.

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:49.750
You led me, and shared a lot of feelings with me.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.490
You're the only friend I can tell how I really feel.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:57.790
I want nothing more than to be
involved in your situation!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.500
You're special to me.

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:03.030
I love you more than I ever imagined
I could love someone!

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:07.180
I said it.

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:10.550
But... I...

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.100
You surprised me.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:18.270
What?

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:22.050
I never thought that Shoko-chan
would say all of this to me.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.610
That? Which?

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:25.590
I feel like that was rude!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:28.280
This is what I get for trying so hard!

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:30.640
I poured it all out for you!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.740
Okay.

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:37.330
I'll tell you the truth.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.660
You've been so upfront with me.

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:43.720
I wouldn't be a real friend if I kept lying to you.

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:46.530
We're best friends, right?

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.290
Really? Really?

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:53.840
You're not just saying that to comfort me?

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:55.350
What are you talking about?

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.000
I was just glad to know you feel that way.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.310
Friends, huh?

00:22:02.560 --> 00:22:04.440
Thank you, Shoko-chan.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:06.550
My best friend.

00:22:09.320 --> 00:22:11.660
Satou!

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:15.580
I'm glad I said it.

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:18.650
I'm no match for you.

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:22.580
You said you'd accept anything,
and I believe you.

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:24.280
I'll tell you the truth.

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:28.810
Can you come to my place first?

00:22:28.810 --> 00:22:31.950
I think it'll be easier to talk there.

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.600
Thank you very much.

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:15.940
Why do I feel like averting my eyes?

00:24:15.940 --> 00:24:18.490
Is it friendship? Lust?

00:24:18.490 --> 00:24:20.060
Or is it love?

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:25.960
7th Life:
"What the Sugar Girl is Made Out Of."
